  """
    Creates a new (preview) version of the workbench dashboard view based on the latest available
    AVP template — the "Try Now" action behind the OOTB Overview dashboard's template-update UI.
  
  AVS calls JSM Reporting `POST /api/v1/views/{viewId}/versions` (with `autoPublish=false`).
    The new version's dashboard provisioning is async on the JSM Reporting / AVP side; the UI
    polls `GET /api/v1/views/{viewId}/versions/{version}` until `dashboardStatus = ACTIVE`.
  
  The returned `taskId` is the JSM Reporting version number (as a string) — a correlation id only;
    AVS does not maintain its own async-task entry for this operation. Accept / Reject / Rollback
    actions are performed by the UI directly against JSM Reporting and are not exposed via AVS.
  
  Returns a failure payload when the `assets_vertical_enable_template_update` feature gate is
    disabled (status 404, code `NOT_FOUND`).
  
