  "Creates a data model and a metric from one out-of-the-box template, atomically. The model is created and published first so that the metric can reference a usable version; if the metric cannot be created the model is removed again, so a caller never sees a half-built pair. cloudId is the browsing tenant and feeds the entitlement guard."
