  avpanalytics_discardModelUpdates(cloudId: ID! @CloudID(owner : "avp"), input: AVPAnalyticsDiscardModelUpdatesInput): AVPAnalyticsDiscardModelUpdatesPayload
  "INTERNAL / admin / test-support only (Pollinator lifecycle teardown & internal cleanup). Not a generally-available capability: physically purges the metric and all of its versions, and is denied (FORBIDDEN) on tenants without the hard-delete dynamic config enabled."
