  """
  Saves Code Reviewer settings for workspaces and repositories the calling user administers on Bitbucket or GitHub.
  Admin rights come from the SCM provider and are checked again on every call. GitHub items are skipped for a user who
  has not linked a GitHub account.
  Error `extensions.errorType` values: BAD_REQUEST, FEATURE_NOT_ENABLED, SCM_UNAVAILABLE and PARTIAL_FAILURE.
  SCM_UNAVAILABLE means a Bitbucket, GitHub or settings lookup failed. PARTIAL_FAILURE means some items could not be
  saved (see `failedCount`). What was saved stays saved, and calling again is safe.
  
  ### Field lifecycle
  
  This field is in the 'EXPERIMENTAL' lifecycle stage
  
  To query this field a client will need to add the '@optIn(to: "DevAiScmAdmin")' query directive to the 'devai_setScmAdminCodeReviewerSettings' field, or to any of its parents.
  
