  """
  Lists an incident's RCA investigations, newest first. Powers the Investigation History popover.
  
  Agentic investigations only, hence no `agentic` argument.
  
  Forward pagination only. Cursors are opaque: pass `pageInfo.endCursor` as `after`. Fewer items than
  `first` may come back, so stop on `pageInfo.hasNextPage`, not on a short page.
  
  Nodes are the same AIOpsInvestigation type as the single-investigation queries — keep the payload
  small by field selection, and load a selected run in full with `aiops_investigationById`.
  
  Returns null with a FORBIDDEN error when the caller may not read the incident's investigations, and
  an empty connection when it has never been investigated.
  
  ### OAuth Scopes
  
  One of the following scopes will need to be present on OAuth requests to get data from this field
  
  * __read:servicedesk-request__
  * __read:request:jira-service-management__
  
