  The field is extremely unstable. It can go through changes at any moment, and its execution can be slow and/or unreliable. Clients should use it with care and at their own risk!
  """
  aiops_investigationsByEntityTypeId(
    "Cursor from the previous page's pageInfo.endCursor, exclusive. Omit on the first call."
    after: String,
    cloudId: ID! @CloudID(collabContextProduct : JIRA_SERVICE_DESK, owner : "jira"),
    entityId: ID!,
    entityType: AIOpsInvestigationSourceEntityType!,
