  """
    Bulk permission check for the current user. A thin, generic wrapper over Identity's
    bulk/permitted API, letting a frontend client evaluate multiple permission checks in a
    single round-trip (e.g. to gate rendering of HAM Admin / HAM User / Jira Admin /
    Assets Admin views).
  
  The principal is always the calling user — it is derived server-side from the User
    Context Token (UCT). Callers pass explicit (resourceId, permissionId) pairs.
  
  On expected failures, returns QueryError instead of data.
  
