  """
  Retrieve comment counts for a dashboard and its charts, for the calling user: the unread comments in
  the dashboard-level thread, and for each chart the comments and unread comments in its unresolved
  threads. Resolved threads are not counted, and unlike `avp_getDashboardComments` no thread is created.
  At most 25 unresolved chart threads are counted, the most recently created first, because each one
  costs a read-state lookup and a page of comments; `truncated` reports whether any were left out.
  Threads of a recently deleted chart may be counted until their deletion completes.
  
  ### OAuth Scopes
  
  One of the following scopes will need to be present on OAuth requests to get data from this field
  
