  The field is extremely unstable. It can go through changes at any moment, and its execution can be slow and/or unreliable. Clients should use it with care and at their own risk!
  """
  avp_getDashboardCommentCounts(dashboardAri: ID! @ARI(interpreted : false, owner : "avp", type : "dashboard", usesActivationId : false)): AVPDashboardCommentCounts @lifecycle(allowThirdParties : false, name : "AVP-graphql-comments", stage : EXPERIMENTAL) @rateLimited(disabled : false, rate : 60, usePerIpPolicy : false, usePerUserPolicy : true) @rateLimited(disabled : false, rate : 700, usePerIpPolicy : false, usePerUserPolicy : false) @scopes(product : JIRA, required : [JIRA_ATLASSIAN_EXTERNAL])
