  """
  The Admin Agent champion request configuration for this site, or the reason there isn't one.
  
  Error cases
      - The state could not be determined — typically a downstream store read failed. Transient,
        so callers should retry rather than treat it as a settled answer. Reported here, and
        deliberately not as a value on `JiraAdminAgentRequestConfigUnavailableReason`, so that a
        client cannot mistake "we could not read it" for `NOT_CONFIGURED` and tell an
        administrator to set up a setting they already set.
