  """
    Whether the device may keep using PSM. Re-runs the full permittance check (tenant onboarded,
    eligible tier, Rovo licence, customer on space) rather than just reading the device record, so a
    lapsed entitlement is caught on the next poll. No writes, no certificate exchange.
  
  A populated `errors` (rather than a status) means "no decision" — never a denial, so keep doing
    what you were doing. Poll again on a 503; a 400 is permanent and retrying it cannot help.
  """
