  """
  Faceted search over unique hostnames (or orgId/unitId/installationId) in the installations-v1 index for a given app,
  scoped by target:
  SITE — root hostName when contextARI contains jira, confluence, or compass, plus
  secondaryContextHosts.hostName where product is jira, confluence, or compass.
  WORKSPACE — root hostName when contextARI contains bitbucket, plus
  secondaryContextHosts.hostName where product is bitbucket.
  ORGANISATION — unique orgId values at the document root.
  UNIT — unique unitId values at the document root.
  INSTALLATION_ID — unique installationId values, returned as both hostName and contextARI.
  When 'name' is omitted, returns all unique pairs for the target (paginated).
  When 'name' is provided, returns only pairs whose searched value begins with that prefix.
  Results are deduplicated and lexicographically sorted. Max 20 per page.
  
  ### The field is not available for OAuth authenticated requests
