    """
    cursor: String,
    """
    Optional prefix to filter values. For SITE/WORKSPACE this is a hostname prefix.
    For ORGANISATION this is an orgId prefix.
    For UNIT this is a unitId prefix.
    For INSTALLATION_ID this is an installationId prefix. When omitted, all unique values
