  """
  Retrieves the complete management chain (report hierarchy) for a specific user,
  traversing up to 10 levels of management above the user's position.
  
  This is the V2 variant of teamworkGraph_userReportChain. It uses a single
  variable-length relationship traversal (external_position_manages_external_position*1..10)
  instead of ~30 OPTIONAL MATCHes, so the whole chain is resolved by Cypher natively
  (no DDB fallback). Managers are grouped one-per-level by traversal depth.
  
  ### OAuth Scopes
  
  One of the following scopes will need to be present on OAuth requests to get data from this field
  
  * __confluence:atlassian-external__
  
