  """
  The Atlassian account id (bare AAID) of the comment author. Resolved into authorUser below via @hydrated; the
  identity `users` resolver matches on accountId, so a bare AAID (not a full ARI) is the correct value, mirroring
  Gira's own Jira Comment.author hydration.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  authorId: ID
  """
  The comment author (name + avatar), hydrated from authorId by the identity service. Comment authors are
  first-party Atlassian users, so this uses the Atlassian-account `users` resolver, matching on accountId (a bare
